{"id":"837712ccdcfab19c","group":"58","path":"58/batch05/58-df-cone.md","title":"Cone","display":"df-cone — Cone","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-cone","aliases":["58-df-cone","Cone"],"display":"df-cone — Cone","depends_on":["[[../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-cone"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-cone</span><span>Cone</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-cone — Cone"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"815e63e5071e7b58\" href=\"?note=815e63e5071e7b58\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md\">../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,CX,\\tau\\in V\\land I=[0,1]\">\\(X,CX,\\tau\\in V\\land I=[0,1]\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"815e63e5071e7b58\" href=\"?note=815e63e5071e7b58\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md\">../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E_X\\subseteq(X\\times I)^2\">\\(E_X\\subseteq(X\\times I)^2\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ConeCarrier}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ConeCarrier}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cone} \\vdash \\begin{aligned}E_X&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\langle\\langle x,s\\rangle,\\langle y,t\\rangle\\rangle\\in(X\\times I)^2\\mid(s=t=0)\\lor(x=y\\land s=t)\\},\\\\ \\mathrm{ConeCarrier}_S(CX,X,\\tau)&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land CX=(X\\times I)/E_X.\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cone} \\vdash \\begin{aligned}E_X&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\langle\\langle x,s\\rangle,\\langle y,t\\rangle\\rangle\\in(X\\times I)^2\\mid(s=t=0)\\lor(x=y\\land s=t)\\},\\\\ \\mathrm{ConeCarrier}_S(CX,X,\\tau)&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land CX=(X\\times I)/E_X.\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The assertion defines the carrier of the cone; its topology is the quotient topology induced from the product topology on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\times I\">\\(X\\times I\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>Cone: contractible space with base <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span>; fundamental in homotopy theory</li>\n<li>Reduced cone: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tilde{C}X = (X \\times I)/(X \\times \\{1\\} \\cup \\{x_0\\} \\times I)\">\\(\\tilde{C}X = (X \\times I)/(X \\times \\{1\\} \\cup \\{x_0\\} \\times I)\\)</span></li>\n<li>Cone functor: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C: \\mathbf{Top}_* \\to \\mathbf{Top}_*\">\\(C: \\mathbf{Top}_* \\to \\mathbf{Top}_*\\)</span> is left adjoint to the suspension <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\">\\(\\Sigma\\)</span></li>\n<li>Application: mapping cone <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C_f = X \\cup_f CY\">\\(C_f = X \\cup_f CY\\)</span> in cofiber sequences</li>\n<li>Topological cone: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x \\cdot t\">\\(x \\cdot t\\)</span> defined for <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t \\geq 0\">\\(t \\geq 0\\)</span>; convex cone requires linear structure</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Hatcher, Algebraic Topology</li>\n<li>Whitehead, Elements of Homotopy Theory</li>\n<li>May, A Concise Course in Algebraic Topology</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"815e63e5071e7b58","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"815e63e5071e7b58","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,CX,\\tau\\in V\\land I=[0,1]","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"E_X\\subseteq(X\\times I)^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ConeCarrier}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cone} \\vdash \\begin{aligned}E_X&\\coloneqq\\{\\langle\\langle x,s\\rangle,\\langle y,t\\rangle\\rangle\\in(X\\times I)^2\\mid(s=t=0)\\lor(x=y\\land s=t)\\},\\\\ \\mathrm{ConeCarrier}_S(CX,X,\\tau)&\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land CX=(X\\times I)/E_X.\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"X\\times I","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"\\tilde{C}X = (X \\times I)/(X \\times \\{1\\} \\cup \\{x_0\\} \\times I)","display":false},{"tex":"C: \\mathbf{Top}_* \\to \\mathbf{Top}_*","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"C_f = X \\cup_f CY","display":false},{"tex":"x \\cdot t","display":false},{"tex":"t \\geq 0","display":false}],"bytes":1470,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-345","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-cone.md|58-df-cone]]（batch05）"}],"outgoing":["815e63e5071e7b58"]}